an give the bags with 1 and 4 candies to one brother and the bags with 2 and 3 to the other brother."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"334A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/334/problem/A"}